{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53457","headline":"三个不归颂 · 自在","name":"三个不归颂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"（按：《全唐诗续补遗》据《监诫录》卷十《高僧谕》条，录伏牛上人《三伤颂》三首，拟传云「王蜀时高僧」。\n今检《宋高僧传》卷十一《唐洛京伏牛山自在传》云：「所着《三伤歌》，辞理俱美，警发迷蒙，有益於代。\n」後接述王蜀乾德间人引此歌事。\n《三伤歌》即《三伤颂》，可知三诗皆元和间自在作，王蜀时另无伏牛上人其人。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"自在","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53457.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53457","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}